### Get my profile
GET {{host}}/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Find all users (pageable, optional search)
GET {{host}}/profile?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Find all users with search
GET {{host}}/profile?search=john&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update my profile
PATCH {{host}}/profile/update
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Johnny",
  "lastName": "Updated"
}

### Change password
PATCH {{host}}/profile/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "newPassword123",
  "newConfirmationPassword": "newPassword123"
}

### Global image storage (administrators only)
GET {{host}}/profile/image-storage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Switch new uploads to Cloudinary without moving old files.
### Set migrate to true to copy referenced files, update their URLs and delete the originals.
### The response reports failed transfers and pending cleanup; repeat with the same provider to retry.
PUT {{host}}/profile/image-storage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"provider": "CLOUDINARY", "migrate": false}

### Delete my account (CAREFUL – permanently deletes user + all owned data)
DELETE {{host}}/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}